ick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lo')\">Lo</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ew')\">Ew</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> &amp; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> critical note (&gt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Stu')\">Stu</lookup> <bdbheb>גֵּרִים</bdbheb>) <b>Hithpolel</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מִתְגּוֺרֵר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 17:20\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(11,17,20)\">1Kgs 17:20</ref> <highlight>seek hospitality with</highlight>, followed by <bdbheb>עִם</bdbheb> (compareArabic x); <bdbheb>יִתְגּוֺרָ֖רוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 7:14\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,14)\">Hos 7:14</ref> is dubious (compare II. <bdbheb>גור</bdbheb>); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AE')\">AE</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ki')\">Ki</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wü')\">Wü</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('AV')\"><reflink>AV</reflink></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RV')\"><reflink>RV</reflink></lookup> <highlight>they assemble themselves</highlight>, but text probably error, see  <bdbheb><reflink>גדד</reflink></bdbheb>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 35:27", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 35, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "Isa 11:6", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 11, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Gen 21:23", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 21, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Gen 32:5", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 32, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ps 120:5", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 120, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Exod 6:4", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 6, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Exod 12:48", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 48}, {"raw": "Gen 20:1", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 20, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Ps 5:5", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "2Kgs 8:2", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 8, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "2Kgs 8:1", "book": "2KI", "chapter":